  "description": "Linux backend for CommunityToolkit.Maui.MediaElement. Adds .UseLinuxMediaElement() to your MAUI app builder; renders video frames via GStreamer (playbin + appsink) into a SkiaSharp surface. Requires GStreamer 1.x + plugin sets installed on the host (gstreamer1-plugins-good/bad/ugly/libav; gstreamer1-vaapi for HW decode). Opt-in: install this package only if your app uses MediaElement on Linux.",
